{"id": "challenge-health-paraphrase-001", "category": "challenge_semantic_memory", "runner": "baseline", "fault_injection": false, "session_id": "eval-challenge-health-paraphrase-001-531163f7", "family_id": "challenge-paraphrase-531163f7", "setup_members": [], "answer": "奶奶今天提到过头疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "tool_calls": [], "command_type": null, "trace_id": "4ae40a66-995f-47d7-9ad1-5e9a9e13caa7", "latency_ms": 4140.63, "turns": [{"response": "奶奶，头有点疼是吗？您先别着急，找个舒服的地方坐下歇一歇，喝点温水。\n\n如果疼得不厉害，可以轻轻揉一揉太阳穴，闭上眼睛休息一会儿。要是疼得越来越厉害，或者伴有头晕、想吐这些情况，一定要赶紧告诉家里人，或者拨打120求助哦。\n\n要不要我帮您看看今天天气怎么样？天气变化有时也会影响身体感觉。您好好休息，有什么需要随时叫我。", "session_id": "eval-challenge-health-paraphrase-001-531163f7-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 4.127239, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:46:08.595389", "trace_id": "7c1de733-828f-4889-a3de-9adb4b99ad86"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "奶奶今天提到过头疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-challenge-health-paraphrase-001-531163f7-father", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.002056, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:46:08.601435", "trace_id": "4ae40a66-995f-47d7-9ad1-5e9a9e13caa7"}, "reminder": null}], "storage_check": null, "harness_trace": []}
