{"id": "challenge-relationship-name-005", "category": "challenge_entity_linking", "runner": "baseline", "fault_injection": false, "session_id": "eval-challenge-relationship-name-005-abfdb13d", "family_id": "challenge-relation-abfdb13d", "setup_members": [{"success": true, "member": {"family_id": "challenge-relation-abfdb13d", "member_name": "王奶奶", "relationship": "奶奶", "age": 70, "created_at": "2026-08-12T18:46:23.552185"}}], "answer": "奶奶今天提到过腿疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "tool_calls": [], "command_type": null, "trace_id": "17135fae-0da5-4989-9576-d0e52664b854", "latency_ms": 4300.25, "turns": [{"response": "听到您腿疼，我有点心疼您。您先别着急，坐下来歇一歇，别太劳累。\n\n我给您几个小建议：可以用温水泡泡脚，或者用热毛巾敷一敷疼的地方，能舒服一些。平时上下楼、走路都要慢一点，注意别滑倒。\n\n不过要提醒您，如果腿疼得厉害、一直不见好，或者腿有红肿、发麻的情况，最好让家人带您去看看医生，可别硬撑着。需要我帮您联系家人吗？", "session_id": "eval-challenge-relationship-name-005-abfdb13d-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 4.287512, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:46:27.843537", "trace_id": "4d978738-a1ef-490f-8dd8-e26d30d7c202"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "奶奶今天提到过腿疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-challenge-relationship-name-005-abfdb13d-grandchild", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.001506, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:46:27.848443", "trace_id": "17135fae-0da5-4989-9576-d0e52664b854"}, "reminder": null}], "storage_check": null, "harness_trace": []}
